# criterion: R6
# origin: design 2026-10-24-ps5-taste-design.md §3 R6 acceptance (a bed in a room typed
#   `uses kitchen`)
# fact: the bed stands in the kitchen beside its sink and hob; judged pieces sink, hob and bed:
#   1 mismatch of 3, R6 = 2/3 (the counter is a bare work surface, not judged)
plan "R6 bed in the kitchen" {
  units mm
  grid 100
  room id=r_hall at (0,0) size 2000x7000 label "Hall" uses hall
  room id=r_kitchen at (2000,0) size 4000x4000 label "Kitchen" uses kitchen
  room id=r_bed at (2000,4000) size 4000x3000 label "Bedroom" uses bedroom
  walls from rooms exterior 200 partition 100
  door id=d_front on r_hall.left at center width 900 swing into r_hall
  door id=d_kitchen between r_hall and r_kitchen at center width 900 swing into r_kitchen
  door id=d_bed between r_hall and r_bed at center width 900 swing into r_bed
  window id=w_kitchen on r_kitchen.top at center width 1500
  window id=w_bed on r_bed.bottom at center width 1500
  furniture kitchen_sink against r_kitchen.right offset 600 in r_kitchen
  furniture stove against r_kitchen.right offset 1500 in r_kitchen
  furniture counter against r_kitchen.right offset 2200 in r_kitchen
  furniture bed in r_kitchen anchor bottom flush size 1400x2000 label "Bed"
}
